{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dKknIlqVvS1792977219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國極右國民聯盟領袖瑪琳勒龐正式展開總統競選活動。民意調查顯示，她的支持度大幅領先主要對手、極左領袖梅朗雄。</p><p></p><p>國民聯盟在法國南部城市奧爾良舉行集會，為瑪琳勒龐明年角逐總統的競選活動揭開序幕。因應近期的示威期間發生搶劫和縱火事件，瑪琳勒龐在集會上表示，國家首要任務是恢復治安。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FRA.LEPEN-0800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yXkC95xrdS1792977214.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>法國總統選舉明年4月舉行。根據民意調查，瑪琳勒龐的支持率大約為三成二，而梅朗雄只有一成七。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FRA.LEPEN-0800_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vD8U3UeAT01792977212.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>在奧爾良市郊，有幾十人舉行未經當局批准的反國民聯盟集會。奧爾良早一日亦有反國民聯盟示威，警方表示有1.3萬人參加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:23.457701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.824431+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:11.454629+00:00","content_hash":"530146a5b8e439e69d464729ccaf1d8c6d1d2c0f8a3fa6f16900d55c3aa5d10c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:23.457701+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}